{
 "encounter_id": "00998",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good to see you, Marcus. It's four weeks since the last injection. How have you been?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any voices?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sometimes. Muffled. Not like before. I can't say when it last happened. Last week? Two?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And sleep?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Broken. Wake up a lot."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any suspicious thoughts, feeling watched?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Not for a while."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let's check the medications."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The injection, paliperidone, maybe 100 mg, monthly. Benztropine, 1 mg, at night. And sertraline, 50 mg, in the morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The nurse will check the injection dose on the chart. Any conditions I should record?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Schizophrenia. Anxiety. And I'm heavier than I was."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Where are you living?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Supported housing. Same place."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Garden centre. Three days a week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "You look calm today, and I see no tremor in your hands."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd say you're stable, with a few rough nights."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Stable. Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Because the injection can raise weight and sugar, I'd like to arrange blood tests to check your cholesterol and sugar."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Keep taking everything as prescribed, and keep your garden centre days, they're good for you."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I like the plants. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you growing at the moment? Tell me about the garden centre, I'm always looking for tips for my own patch. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Mostly tomatoes and herbs this month. The manager lets me look after the small greenhouse by myself on Wednesdays, and I water everything and write down the numbers. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That sounds like exactly the kind of routine that helps people stay well. Does anyone at work know about your treatment, or is that private? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The manager knows a bit. Nobody else. I prefer it that way, and she never asks me questions I don't want to answer. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That sounds like a very sensible and supportive arrangement, and it's your decision who knows. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I do think about telling one friend there, Dale, because he's kind. Maybe in the spring when things are quieter. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's no hurry at all. If you'd like to talk it through, we can do that at your next visit, or the support team can help too. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Maybe. I'll think about it over the next few weeks while I'm planting. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. And how is the bus journey to work these days, is that still manageable for you on the three days? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's fine now. I leave early, and I sit at the front, and the driver knows me. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm glad. Little routines like that make a real difference. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in four weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  }
